<resources>
    <!-- Autumn gold for the default palette. Names stay golden_* so the saved
         colorPalette key and the LauncherGolden alias keep working.
         Hue is about 45 degrees. The page is near-white ivory; ink is a deep
         gold (white on it is about 7:1, ink on ivory about 7:1). primary_dark
         and lite alias ink because both are used as text. Icon gold is darker
         than the button so a 24dp glyph stays above 3:1 on ivory. -->
